I've seen posts of naked ascentions, racial ascentions, etc, and there
where a few cases (I remember at least one) where the player was
forced to ascend without MR. It was there I learned the trick of
quaffing an hallucination potion to counter touches of death (note:
IIRC, this does not work on Death, just rodney, L, etc).

Appart from the !oH, there is of course the limited protection of a
few "oLS, and the fact that not all Touches of Death (from Death,
Rodney, L, etc) succeed. For example, Death has two touch of death
attacks, and there is only 15% for each of being an effective deathly
touch (as opposing to just draining your life or failing at all).

I've recently posted a MR-less ascention, on 2nd September
(http://groups.google.com/group/rec.games.roguelike.nethack/
browse_thread/thread/1571da4d80ac82ca#,
"YAAP: 6 conducts + magic-resistance-less samurai").
I think I had at least one failed ToD from L, another L made me burn a
"oLS, and as for Death, I was so excited to be on Astral I forgot my
situation and went to melee it. Death only had 1 turn to attack: 1st
attack burnt my last "oLS and the second failed (drained life, I
think).
Oh, and I only encountered rodney twice (as lawful!!).

So yes, MR is very very very nice, and I was a bit lucky. But strictly
speaking its not absolutely necessary.

